  "solution": "BODMAS Table:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7469776d8b5353b3e336b6395ae8257280794a1d7a06ead22e8b607d2875fb7b.png] \n\nGiven equation: 72 × 6 + 18 ÷ 5 - 9 = 93\n\nLet's check each option by interchanging the signs,\n\n1) × and +\n\n→ 72 × 6 + __**18 ÷ 5**__ - 9 = 93\n\n→ __**72 × 6**__ + 3.6 - 9 = 93\n\n→ __**43**____**2 + 3.6**__ - 9 = 93\n\n→ __435____.6** - 9**__ = 93\n\n→ 426.6 ≠ 93\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS.\n\n2) + and -\n\n→ 72 × 6 - __**18 ÷ 5**__ + 9 = 93\n\n→ __**72 × 6**__ - 3.6 + 9 = 93\n\n→ __**432**__ - 3.6 __**+ 9**__ = 93\n\n→ __**441**____** - 3.6**__ = 93\n\n→ 437.4 ≠ 38\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS.\n\n3) ÷ and -\n\n→ 72 × 6 + 18 - __**5 ÷ 9**__ = 93\n\n→ __**72 × 6**__ + 18 - 0.55 = 93\n\n→ __**432 **____**+ 18**__ - 0.55 = 93\n\n→ __**450 - 0.55**__ = 93\n\n→ 449.45 ≠ 93\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS.\n\n4) × and ÷\n\n→ __**72 ÷ 6**__ + 18 × 5 - 9 = 93\n\n→ 12 + __**18 × 5**__ - 9 = 93\n\n→ __**12 + 90**__ - 9 = 93\n\n→ __**102 - 9**__ = 93\n\n→ LHS = RHS.\n\nHere, we can see that only 'Option 4' satisfies the equation.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4****\"**.",
